Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kaha bag-o: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault i-encrypt: message yawe: key.
>> decrypted := vault i-decrypt: encrypted yawe: key.

Gawas 
isulat: ['Message:'], bag-ong-linya
isulat: message, bag-ong-linya
isulat: ['Decrypted:'], bag-ong-linya
isulat: decrypted, bag-ong-linya.
